obs Proven on a real projection rather than from the manifest alone: sow_project.sh into a pen answers SOW_OK copied=8660 scrubbed=1431 withheld=137, and context/ stands in that seed with twenty files, context/README.md among them. The link the guard called dead opens a room the projection actually makes.
